  "sentence": {
    "text": "As we go through the program, each dimension of awareness that we explore, and so each chapter of the course, will have three parts. The first is an orientation. I'll introduce a theme of awareness, explore and explain its qualities, and its implications for transforming your experience and your understanding. Then, there's a guided meditation for each quality, leading you into and through that particular dimension of awareness , experientially. The meditations can be practiced as they are, or the time can be extended if you like. They can be done sequentially, or repeated as many times as you like.",
    "start_time": 0.0,
    "end_time": 46.12
  },
